                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "A rogue gang called the Dogs of War you say? I suppose it is not impossible for a criminal faction to falsely implicate Marleybone.",
